- Coherence-based promotion/demotion between tiers
- Pattern relationship tracking with pruning
- Quantum state preservation during migrations

Key files:
```
src/memory/memory_tier_manager.cpp
src/memory/quantum_coherence_manager.cpp
```

3. Quantum Binary State Analysis (QBSA)
- Bit-level analysis for quantum state verification
- Coherence scoring through derivative cascades
- Rupture detection using symmetry analysis
- Pattern clustering based on quantum properties

Key files:
```
src/quantum/qbsa.cpp
