4. Core Processing Pipeline
```
Pattern Intake -> Quantum Analysis -> Coherence Calculation -> 
Memory Tier Assignment -> Evolution/Mutation -> State Verification
```

The business logic centers around maintaining quantum coherence while enabling controlled pattern evolution. Key metrics like stability, entropy, and relationship strengths drive the system's behavior.

